    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 19 Woodstown Heath, Knocklyon, Dublin 16 to the market a superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential development. Woodstown Heath is a well-established and family-friendly neighbourhood, renowned for its peaceful surroundings and exceptional convenience. A wealth of amenities are within easy reach including Knocklyon Shopping Centre, Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre, together with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and leisure facilities. The area is also home to a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while St. Enda's Park, Marlay Park and a variety of sporting amenities are all close by. Excellent public transport links and easy access to the M50 further enhance this prime location.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to approximately 92 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, generous lounge, fully fitted kitchen with dining area, and guest wc on the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three well-proportioned bedrooms including a master ensuite, together with a main family bathroom. The property offers a practical and well-balanced layout perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nNo. 19 further benefits from off street parking to the front, a convenient side entrance and a sunny rear garden laid in lawn, providing an ideal space for children to play or for outdoor entertaining during the warmer months. The added advantage of no onward chain ensures a smooth and straightforward purchase for the successful buyer.\n\nWhether you're a first-time buyer looking to step onto the property ladder or a growing family searching for a home in a well-established and highly desirable location, No. 19 is sure to impress. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 92 sqm\n• BER D1\n• 3 Bed / 3 Bath\n• Semi detached home \n• Off street parking \n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen \n• Perfect blank canvas \n• Side entrance\n• Sunny rear garden in lawn \n• Bright and airy\n• No onwards chain \n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \n• Highly sought after location \n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D16 RK06"
      },
      {
